<title>USA: TB Wood's buys Deck Manufacturing assets.</title>
<headline>TB Wood's buys Deck Manufacturing assets.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMBERSBURG, Pa. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TB Wood's Corp said Wednesday its TB Wood's Inc subsidiary has acquired certain assets of Deck Manufacturing Corp located in Granger, Ind., an established manufacturer of industrial gear couplings.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed by TB Wood's.</p>
<p>The company said the acquisition provides long term earnings growth potential and broadens TB Wood's current coupling product offering.</p>
</text>
